-buchholz-collapsing-function</a> 中同时递归定义的类函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文件是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"50076d54977c5fd6\" href=\"?note=50076d54977c5fd6\" title=\"18-thm-collapsing-comparison\">18-thm-collapsing-comparison</a> 的原编号重述入口；所有参数域与该节点相同，下式不引入另一套数学对象或证明关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha\\le\\beta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nC(\\alpha)\\subseteq C(\\beta)\\ \\land\\ \\psi(\\alpha)\\le\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\n\\alpha\\in C(\\beta)\\cap\\beta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\nC(\\alpha)\\cap\\Omega&amp;=\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\Omega.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha\\le\\beta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nC(\\alpha)\\subseteq C(\\beta)\\ \\land\\ \\psi(\\alpha)\\le\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\n\\alpha\\in C(\\beta)\\cap\\beta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\nC(\\alpha)\\cap\\Omega&amp;=\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\Omega.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件名以兼容已有入口，结论与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"50076d54977c5fd6\" href=\"?note=50076d54977c5fd6\" title=\"18-thm-collapsing-comparison\">18-thm-collapsing-comparison</a> 一致。源页码和证明审阅状态沿用原记录；本轮没有新增原书页码核验或证明助理验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-collapsing-closure","status":"resolved","id":"6b3f52af2d45c0ea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-collapsing-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function","status":"resolved","id":"d042b39a8b79bc06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","